      "preferredSourceId": "datospr-cbp-2014-municipios",
      "notes": "Municipality-level CBP data is the closest replacement for the legacy cbps table. NAICS titles are not present in the Datos.PR CSV headers sampled on 2026-05-22, but the Census 2014 CBP variable metadata confirms NAICS2012_TTL as the title field. Live Census row queries require an API key in this environment.",
      "columns": [
        {
